; Open handler of the small insignificant crack
;
; The handler of the crack (OBJ_SMALL_INSIGNIFICANT) for the verb open ($10),
; from its verb table. The crack can only be opened by a character who is in
; the dark stuffy passage $0F (the first location in the acting character's
; record); from anywhere else the command is refused (#R$9F76: "cannot open").
; In the passage the normal open handler runs (#R$910E, which tests locked and
; open).
; .
; Observed: a nasty goblin in $0F opens it (verbs.txt). The actor is read from
; ActorRecord, the noun from Noun1Record by #R$910E.
;
; Hardware: none.
@label=OpenCrack
c$A368 LD IX,($B70C) ; actor record
 $A36C LD A,(IX+$10) ; actor's location
@isub=CP LOC_DARK_STUFFY_PASSA_0F
 $A36F CP $0F
 $A371 JP NZ,$9F76   ; not in the passage: refuse
 $A374 JP $910E      ; the normal open
